# shellcheck shell=bash
# Invocation behind output/evaluation/der_summary.json and der_report.csv
# (the shipped pipeline on the held-out AMI test split).
#
# Job 8976354 (au_der_default), 2026-10-04, account <project-b>, an NVIDIA
# L40S on htc-g070, from the clone ~/paper_speech_transcription_audit_w2 at
# code 9cb43e3 with a clean tree, as its environment record and the
# summary's run_metadata say. The record, environment/au_der_default_8976354.txt
# beside the original's results on ARC, gives the effective parameters
# SPLIT=test, MIX_MODE=timeline, CACHE_DIR=${DATA}/ami_cache and
# EXTRA_ARGS=none. Its log, logs/benchmark_der_8976354.out in that clone,
# shows the preflight passing with --diarisation-required and the 16
# meetings read from the timeline cache job 8534741 built on 2026-08-10.
#
# Job 8534772 (2026-08-10, htc-g067, code not recorded) ran these settings
# first; its files are in git at aaffb81. The two runs agree on every
# meeting but EN2002c, whose reference since 2bb4224 keeps both speakers of
# a turn they share (audit finding EDER-02).
#
# CACHE_DIR below is the script's default at 9cb43e3, written out so that a
# later change of the default cannot change what this record reproduces.
# The other variables the script turns into arguments are set empty: sbatch
# passes the submitting shell's variables through, and a value left there
# would otherwise reach the job, which ran with none of them.
#
# Reproduce (from the repository root on ARC), on the card type the
# original ran on:
#   ( set -a; . hpc/runs/der_default.env || exit 1; set +a
#     sbatch --account='<your-project>' --gres=gpu:l40s:1 hpc/submit_benchmark_der.sh )
#
# A reproduction writes to its own directory under repro/, so it cannot
# overwrite the ARC copy of the original run it is to be compared with.
# original: REPORT_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/audit2026/der/der_default"
SPLIT=test
MIX_MODE=timeline
CACHE_DIR="${DATA}/ami_cache"
LIMIT_MEETINGS=
MAX_MINUTES=
UTT_PER_MEETING=
CLUSTERING_THRESHOLD=
MIN_CLUSTER_SIZE=
MIN_DURATION_OFF=
SEGMENTATION_MODEL=
ORACLE_NUM_SPEAKERS=
REPORT_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/repro/der_default"
